# Staging environment variable names (no secrets)

```
APP_ENV=staging
SERVER_PORT=8080
DATABASE_URL=
DATABASE_USER=
DATABASE_PASSWORD=
REDIS_URL=
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_TTL_SECONDS=900
JWT_REFRESH_TTL_SECONDS=2592000
S3_ENDPOINT=
S3_BUCKET=
S3_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_SECRET_KEY=
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=
```

Use Razorpay **test** mode keys in staging.
